{"page":468,"verses":[{"verse_key":"40:8","surah":40,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا وَأَدْخِلْهُمْ جَنَّـٰتِ عَدْنٍ ٱلَّتِى وَعَدتَّهُمْ وَمَن صَلَحَ مِنْ ءَابَآئِهِمْ وَأَزْوَٰجِهِمْ وَذُرِّيَّـٰتِهِمْ ۚ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and admit them, Lord, to the lasting Gardens You have promised to them, together with their righteous ancestors, spouses, and offspring: You alone are the Almighty, the All Wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"رَبَّنَا","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَأَدْخِلْهُمْ","en_gloss":"And admit them","transliteration":"wa-adkhil'hum","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَنَّـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(to) Gardens","transliteration":"jannāti","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَدْنٍ","en_gloss":"(of) Eden","transliteration":"ʿadnin","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَعَدتَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"You have promised them","transliteration":"waʿadttahum","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"صَلَحَ","en_gloss":"(was) righteous","transliteration":"ṣalaḥa","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ءَابَآئِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their fathers","transliteration":"ābāihim","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأَزْوَٰجِهِمْ","en_gloss":"and their spouses","transliteration":"wa-azwājihim","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَذُرِّيَّـٰتِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"and their offspring","transliteration":"wadhurriyyātihim","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed You","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"You","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","en_gloss":"(are) the All-Mighty","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","verse_key":"40:8"},{"pos":16,"