وْنَ إِلَى ٱلْإِيمَـٰنِ فَتَكْفُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But those who disbelieved will be told, ‘When you were called to the faith and rejected it, God’s disgust with you was even greater then than the self-disgust you feel [today].’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُنَادَوْنَ","en_gloss":"will be cried out to them","transliteration":"yunādawna","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَمَقْتُ","en_gloss":"Certainly Allah's hatred","transliteration":"lamaqtu","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Certainly Allah's hatred","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَكْبَرُ","en_gloss":"(was) greater","transliteration":"akbaru","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"than","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَّقْتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your hatred","transliteration":"maqtikum","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَنفُسَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(of) yourselves","transliteration":"anfusakum","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تُدْعَوْنَ","en_gloss":"you were called","transliteration":"tud'ʿawna","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْإِيمَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"the faith","transliteration":"l-īmāni","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَتَكْفُرُونَ","en_gloss":"and you disbelieved","transliteration":"fatakfurūna","verse_key":"40:10"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٠","en_gloss":"(10)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"40:10"}]},{"verse_key":"40:11","surah":40,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ رَبَّنَآ أَمَتَّنَا ٱثْنَتَيْنِ وَأَحْيَيْتَنَا ٱثْنَتَيْنِ فَٱعْتَرَفْنَا بِذُنُوبِنَا فَهَلْ إِلَىٰ خُرُوجٍ مِّن سَبِيلٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will say, ‘Our Lord, twice You have caused us to be lifeless and twice You have brought us to life. Now we recognize our sins. Is there any way out?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They (will) say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبَّنَآ","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمَتَّنَا","en_gloss":"You gave us death","transliteration":"amattanā","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱثْنَتَيْنِ","en_gloss":"twice","transliteration":"ith'natayni","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَحْيَيْتَنَا","en_gloss":"and You gave us life","transliteration":"wa-aḥyaytanā","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱثْنَتَيْنِ","en_gloss":"twice","transliteration":"ith'natayni","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَٱعْتَرَفْنَا","en_gloss":"and we confess","transliteration":"fa-iʿ'tarafnā","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِذُنُوبِنَا","en_gloss":"our sins","transliteration":"bidhunūbinā","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَهَلْ","en_gloss":"So is (there)","transliteration":"fahal","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خُرُوجٍۢ","en_gloss":"get out","transliteration":"khurūjin","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سَبِيلٍۢ","en_gloss":"way","transliteration":"sabīlin","verse_key":"40:11"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١١","en_gloss":"(11)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"40:11"}]},{"verse_key":"40:12","surah":40,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُم بِأَنَّهُۥٓ إِذَا دُعِىَ ٱللَّهُ وَحْدَهُۥ كَفَرْتُمْ ۖ وَإِن يُشْرَكْ بِهِۦ تُؤْمِنُوا۟ ۚ فَٱلْحُكْمُ لِلَّهِ ٱلْعَلِىِّ ٱلْكَبِيرِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[They will be told], ‘This is all because when God alone was invoked you rejected this, yet when others were associated with Him you believed [in them].’ Judgement belongs to God the Most High, the Most Great.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكُم","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālikum","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِأَنَّهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"(is) because","transliteration":"bi-annahu","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"دُعِىَ","en_gloss":"Allah was invoked","transliteration":"duʿiya","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah was invoked","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَحْدَهُۥ","en_gloss":"Alone","transliteration":"waḥdahu","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَفَرْتُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"you disbelieved","transliteration":"kafartum","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"but if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُشْرَكْ","en_gloss":"(others) were associated","transliteration":"yush'rak","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"with Him","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تُؤْمِنُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"you believed","transliteration":"tu'minū","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَٱلْحُكْمُ","en_gloss":"So the judgment","transliteration":"fal-ḥuk'mu","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"(is) with Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْعَلِىِّ","en_gloss":"the Most High","transliteration":"l-ʿaliyi","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْكَبِيرِ","en_gloss":"the Most Great","transliteration":"l-kabīri","verse_key":"40:12"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٢","en_gloss":"(12)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"40:12"}]},{"verse_key":"40:13","surah":40,"ayah":13,"ar_uthmani":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِى يُرِيكُمْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ وَيُنَزِّلُ لَكُم مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ رِزْقًا ۚ وَمَا يَتَذَكَّرُ إِلَّا مَن يُنِيبُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who shows you [people] His signs and sends water down from the sky to sustain you, though only those who turn to God will 